"Mode = 1 returns the one-tailed test, Mode = 2 returns the two-tailed test."
msgstr ""
" O modo = 1 devolve o test dunha cola e o modo = 2 devolve o test con duas "
"colas."

#. i18n: file: functions/statistical.xml:1383
